00:00:59.679 --> 00:01:00.841
And they're bad asses.

00:01:00.841 --> 00:01:02.372
And we have big meals together.

00:01:02.372 --> 00:01:04.656
We went to this African
restaurant more than once

00:01:04.656 --> 00:01:06.588
and we just took it over.

00:01:06.588 --> 00:01:09.453
We enjoyed spending time
together, on and off set.

00:01:09.453 --> 00:01:10.636
(light playful bell music)
What's going on?

00:01:10.636 --> 00:01:11.551
What?

00:01:11.551 --> 00:01:13.634
(laughs)

00:01:14.634 --> 00:01:16.968
Ooh, we had like a six week boot camp

00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:19.659
and we'd have like a group
session with all the Dora Milaje

00:01:19.659 --> 00:01:23.666
and then we'd break off and
learn our individual skills.

00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:25.891
It was really tough of the
body and also really cool

00:01:25.891 --> 00:01:29.366
because the more I exerted physically,

00:01:29.366 --> 00:01:31.035
the more I felt like I was getting

00:01:31.035 --> 00:01:32.824
into the Nakia zone of it all.

00:01:32.824 --> 00:01:34.063
I lost one puppy.

00:01:34.063 --> 00:01:37.496
I bet she's the only one that likes me.

00:01:37.496 --> 00:01:38.879
(laughs)

