use a light moisturizer.

00:01:47.103 --> 00:01:50.044
Lancome day cream that's
known as Energie De Vie.

00:01:50.044 --> 00:01:53.197
I try and not wear makeup
when I don't need it.

00:01:53.197 --> 00:01:56.626
And then I am very religious
about taking my makeup off.

00:01:56.626 --> 00:01:59.863
Avocado oil to take off my
makeup because it's gentle.

